+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: the endpoint-directed legal-pair scan is polynomial, with "
+        "complexity O(n^3(|V|+|E|)); at the shipping preset its measured wall-clock "
+        "and exact membership-test count are recorded in selftest_report.json, "
+        "whereas the incidence leaf-peeling route uses at most 143 link/move "
+        "operations."
