- `medium` had one failed oracle attempt, followed by HTTP 403 key-limit errors. It remains provisional, not hardened.
- No `REJECTED.md` was created because this is an infrastructure block, not a G/H/V failure.

The construction uses the paper’s native TAR dominating-set objects and inverse-generates a unique shortest reconfiguration word. The paper’s constructive polynomial results make Track B the honest classification. [Original arXiv paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.16726).

After replenishing the OpenRouter budget, resume with:

